# CLAUDE.md exists in both this repository and cic-factory-core, deliberately
# with different content: there it says how to develop the core, here it says how
# CIC operates the factory. Without this, every release merge conflicts on it.
#
# Requires a one-time local setup, because git has no built-in "ours" file
# driver:
#
#   git config merge.ours.driver true
#
# Without that config git falls back to a normal merge and the conflict returns —
# so if a release merge ever conflicts on CLAUDE.md, that config is missing.
CLAUDE.md merge=ours
